      "side": 1,
      "message": "Electrical and protocol transitions that alter VBUS should assert a UCSI CCI change bit and raise a hardware IRQ. The interrupt handler sets CCI_EVENT, causing the PDC state machine to issue CMD_PDC_GET_CONNECTOR_STATUS. When received, handle_connector_status() updates the cache.\n\nAdditionally, port-\u003evbus is explicitly reset to 0 when !status-\u003econnect_status and upon entering pdc_unattached_entry(). pdc_power_mgmt_api.c was updated to verify this.",
